{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-------------------------------- Beat your enemies to a pulp! --------------------------------</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >keep your guard up; each hit landed buffs you and debuffs your target!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/9e0331496c0fac6f10104966b038a945.poster.avif?t=1756434174\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/9e0331496c0fac6f10104966b038a945.webm?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/9e0331496c0fac6f10104966b038a945.mp4?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>------------------------------------------ SWORDS!!! -----------------------------------------</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >carry up to 4 and swap between them at will without delay!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each sword has 2 movesets, one for each hand, created semi-random: experiment!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/97c5dbf1bec776d03ece93d1c606c985.poster.avif?t=1756434174\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/97c5dbf1bec776d03ece93d1c606c985.webm?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/97c5dbf1bec776d03ece93d1c606c985.mp4?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>------------------------------ Nothing can stand in your way! -------------------------------</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hack and slash the world itself to bathe in blood and heal your wounds!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/b515b85608d48879641ddb2993383a82.poster.avif?t=1756434174\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/b515b85608d48879641ddb2993383a82.webm?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/b515b85608d48879641ddb2993383a82.mp4?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>--------------------------------- Enlightened by the sword! ----------------------------------</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >master range, speed, and your character; the Ai won't hold back so neither should you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/bee5804d21d38805035f57564f8066d0.poster.avif?t=1756434174\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/bee5804d21d38805035f57564f8066d0.webm?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/bee5804d21d38805035f57564f8066d0.mp4?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>------------------------------------- Positioning is key! --------------------------------------</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hitboxes are exactly the shape of the swords, no need to rely solely on iframes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/fcc763273a0e8ecf84b822d33d577d94.poster.avif?t=1756434174\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/fcc763273a0e8ecf84b822d33d577d94.webm?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/fcc763273a0e8ecf84b822d33d577d94.mp4?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-------------------------- Weapon Clash to unleash your strength! --------------------------</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >match your target's attack to clash: vertical, horizontal or thrust</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >add combo punishes to your target; execute your combo precisely for maximum damage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/847341e8a15070c01934744cc405d4e0.poster.avif?t=1756434174\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/847341e8a15070c01934744cc405d4e0.webm?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/847341e8a15070c01934744cc405d4e0.mp4?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>------------------------------ CLAIM YOUR PLACE IN THE SKY!!! ----------------------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/3c495ed806e354f76e35c60b79297534.poster.avif?t=1756434174\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/3c495ed806e354f76e35c60b79297534.webm?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/3c495ed806e354f76e35c60b79297534.mp4?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >intellectually demanding combat system: no 1 button to parry, no iframes vs everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many characters: each with its own properties affecting how they perform in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Stats: stats update based on your performance, level up/down in real-time</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty modes: casual and ranked; ranked uses randomized movesets and combat inputs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic inventory: weapons represent movesets; pick up/drop AND equip/unequip them using inputs dynamically - no menus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player-like Ai: enemies are coded to behave like players so it feels like multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decay: health depletes over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorials: it's mandatory to play the tutorials before playing the game in order to have a basic understanding of the combat system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Lock On: move the camera and the character freely while locked on to a target</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard/Mouse and Controller support: select your device in game to display the correct icons; also select your input layout; each difficulty mode has its own custom layout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your UI: hide/show all the panels and the world icons for a more immersive experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Important:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UE5 requires Microsoft C++ redistributables to be installed in order to run the game; the first time you open the game it checks to define whether to install Microsoft C++ redistributables or not: if it has to install it then a wizard will open and you will be guided through the installation - it takes less than a minute, no internet/downloading required. After the installation, the game will continue to load.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game requires agreeing to a EULA before you can play the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If playing on the Steamdeck: please select the optimization settings for the Steamdeck when the game first opens so you can have a 60-80 fps experience with minimum quality loss on the Steamdeck. If you miss-select the initial optimization option, you can reselect it in the main menu, in the optimizations tab, in the initial settings tab.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If having any compatibility issues on the Steamdeck, please enforce Proton 9: this is the one where the game was tested and runs without issues.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>------------------------------------------- P.S --------------------------------------------------</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can dual wield Odachis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're welcome :D<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/9739e378fbb3f5e410227723cb5e61dd.poster.avif?t=1756434174\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/9739e378fbb3f5e410227723cb5e61dd.webm?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/9739e378fbb3f5e410227723cb5e61dd.mp4?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870780?t=1756434174","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/b076db242989716bd80ef44c6bcde7f3e783aa8f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756434174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/a2b1a0e94f5b6fbe8659912d7ef86755229e7890/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756434174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/a2b1a0e94f5b6fbe8659912d7ef86755229e7890/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756434174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game ma