"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/847341e8a15070c01934744cc405d4e0.mp4?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>------------------------------ CLAIM YOUR PLACE IN THE SKY!!! ----------------------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/3c495ed806e354f76e35c60b79297534.poster.avif?t=1756434174\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/3c495ed806e354f76e35c60b79297534.webm?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/3c495ed806e354f76e35c60b79297534.mp4?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >intellectually demanding combat system: no 1 button to parry, no iframes vs everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many characters: each with its own properties affecting how they perform in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Stats: stats update based on your performance, level up/down in real-time</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty modes: casual and ranked; ranked uses randomized movesets and combat inputs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic inventory: weapons represent movesets; pick up/drop AND equip/unequip them using inputs dynamically - no menus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player-like Ai: enemies are coded to behave like players so it feels like multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decay: health depletes over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorials: it's mandatory to play the tutorials before playing the game in order to have a basic understanding of the combat system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Lock On: move the camera and the character freely while locked on to a target</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard/Mouse and Controller support: select your device in game to display the correct icons; also select your input layout; each difficulty mode has its own custom layout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your UI: hide/show all the panels and the world icons for a more immersive experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Important:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UE5 requires Microsoft C++ redistributables to be installed in order to run the game; the first time you open the game it checks to define whether to install Microsoft C++ redistributables or not: if it has to install it then a wizard will open and you will be guided through the installation - it takes less than a minute, no internet/downloading required. After the installation, the game will continue to load.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game requires agreeing to a EULA before you can play the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If playing on the Steamdeck: please select the optimization settings for the Steamdeck when the game first opens so you can have a 60-80 fps experience with minimum quality loss on the Steamdeck. If you miss-select the initial optimization option, you can reselect it in the main menu, in the optimizations tab, in the initial settings tab.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If having any compatibility issues on the Steamdeck, please enforce Proton 9: this is the one where the game was tested and runs without issues.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>------------------------------------------- P.S --------------------------------------------------</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can dual wield Odachis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're welcome :D<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/9739e378fbb3f5e410227723cb5e61dd.poster.avif?t=1756434174\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/9739e378fbb3f5e410227723cb5e61dd.webm?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/9739e378fbb3f5e410227723cb5e61dd.mp4?t=1756434174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ExoticaMachina"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/d8a7f46aeadd987fdd68826116b22760a98e01d4/header.jpg?t=1756434174","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257172671,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172671/movie480.mp4?t=1756433326","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172671/movie_max.mp4?t=1756433326"},"name":"Nekurogahara: Psycho Ron